@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1F2937
 BorderColor #94A3B8
 FontColor #F3F4F6
 DiamondBackgroundColor #164E63
 DiamondBorderColor #67E8F9
 DiamondFontColor #F3F4F6
 StartColor #67E8F9
 EndColor #67E8F9
}
title Requirement-linked Quality Verification
start
:Select governing criterion and preserve its status;
:Identify candidate revision, configuration,
environment and representative workload;
:Define observable expected behavior
and applicable measurement / threshold;
if (Required inputs and targets resolved?) then (yes)
 :Run scoped normal, concurrent and failure scenarios;
 :Collect bounded metrics, outcomes
and recovery / accessibility observations;
 :Compare actual results with governing criteria;
 if (Criteria met with adequate evidence?) then (yes)
  :Attach evidence and limitations to RTM / release record;
 else (no)
  :Record failure, affected capability
and corrective work;
 endif
else (no)
 :Record unresolved input, owner and required evidence;
endif
:Keep affected gate open until evidence supports acceptance;
stop
@enduml
